# Keep generated data and code in LF on every machine.
# 2026-09-20: a Windows-side commit (e826f2d5) wrote CRLF into data/calibration/*.csv,
# which broke header parsing and silently turned off K self-calibration.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
